<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Welcome to PH Healthcare</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
        .icon { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #e0f2fe; color: #0284c7; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        h2 { color: #0f172a; margin-top: 0; }
        p { line-height: 1.6; color: #475569; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background: #0284c7; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 16px; }
        .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; padding-top: 16px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="icon">&#10003;</div>
        <h2>Welcome to PH Healthcare!</h2>
        <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
        <p>Your account has been successfully created and verified. We are thrilled to have you as part of the PH Healthcare family!</p>
        <p>You can now log in to book appointments with top doctors, manage your medical history, and access all our healthcare services.</p>
        <div class="footer">&copy; PH Healthcare System. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
